{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fallen deep into a forgotten mine, you take control of a stranded miner in this atmospheric 2D platformer. Explore dark tunnels, jump across perilous gaps, and use your pickaxe to break through obstacles and fend off dangerous creatures like bats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master your abilities, uncover secrets, and find a way back to the surface\u2014before the mine becomes your tomb.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were walking with your friend Bob when, without warning, the ground beneath you gave way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/Heruntergefallen.png?t=1746125076\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both of you plunged into an abandoned mine. When you woke up, Bob was gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Determined to find him \u2014 and a way out \u2014 you set off into the depths of the mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/Auf_suche_machen_.png?t=1746125076\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suddenly, you spot something in the darkness... You're not alone down here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/Miene_istgef\u00e4hrlich_.png?t=1746125076\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore, you reach a collapsed tunnel, blocked by rocks. Searching the area, you discover a pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/Pickaxe_gefunden_.png?t=1746125076\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the power of the pickaxe in hand, you can now break through obstacles and venture deeper into the mine, uncovering clues about what happened to Bob.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/Miene_erkunden_.png?t=1746125076\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to find him \u2014 and make it out alive?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637450?t=1746125076","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637450?t=1746125076","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/ac525ef9f7ed0dac258953338cc4f08b41d28714/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746125076","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/ac525ef9f7ed0dac258953338cc4f08b41d28714/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746125076","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3702350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fallen deep into a forgotten mine, you take control of a stranded miner in this atmospheric 2D platformer. Explore dark tunnels, jump across perilous gaps, and use your pickaxe to break through obstacles and fend off dangerous creatures like bats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master your abilities, uncover secrets, and find a way back to the surface\u2014before the mine becomes your tomb.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were walking with your friend Bob when, without warning, the ground beneath you gave way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/Heruntergefallen.png?t=1746125076\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both of you plunged into an abandoned mine. When you woke up, Bob was gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Determined to find him \u2014 and a way out \u2014 you set off into the depths of the mine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/Auf_suche_machen_.png?t=1746125076\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suddenly, you spot something in the darkness... You're not alone down here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/Miene_istgef\u00e4hrlich_.png?t=1746125076\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore, you reach a collapsed tunnel, blocked by rocks. Searching the area, you discover a pickaxe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/Pickaxe_gefunden_.png?t=1746125076\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the power of the pickaxe in hand, you can now break through obstacles and venture deeper into the mine, uncovering clues about what happened to Bob.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/extras/Miene_erkunden_.png?t=1746125076\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to find him \u2014 and make it out alive?</p>","developers":["DevsPlayground"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/78e3c7ecc4d38d4d9032121edf11a1fd25195a98/header.jpg?t=1746125076","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257128330,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128330/movie480.mp4?t=1745606570","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128330/movie_max.mp4?t=1745606570"},"name":"The Forgotten Mine Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257128330/e36656e2c4f9b78b772bee5ae2f8b1eb5d44f089/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745606570","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128330/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745606570","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257128330/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745606570"}}],"name":"The Forgotten Mine","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["DevsPlayground"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Q2 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/7634b2f8819547564811abe6eacdfae2aa2ddd68/ss_7634b2f8819547564811abe6eacdfae2aa2ddd68.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746125076","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/7634b2f8819547564811abe6eacdfae2aa2ddd68/ss_7634b2f8819547564811abe6eacdfae2aa2ddd68.600x338.jpg?t=1746125076"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/95ee340a25dc504d4b7e91abd00ce240bea46fdf/ss_95ee340a25dc504d4b7e91abd00ce240bea46fdf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746125076","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.s