.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746125076","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637450/9896b99902c67253f09748d7f819d280cae2f4ca/ss_9896b99902c67253f09748d7f819d280cae2f4ca.600x338.jpg?t=1746125076"}],"short_description":"The Forgotten Mine is a small 2D Platformer, from a young small Team.In this Platformer you fell into a mine where nobody was for years. You had a friend with you, but since you woke up the friend is gone. So you're going to search for your friend and for an exit of the mine","steam_appid":3637450,"support_info":{"email":"devsplayground@gmx.de","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}